Headphones Assistant Developer Website

Headphone Assistant helps you check whether your headphones sound right—using clear on-device test tones and your own listening feedback.

New earbuds, one side quieter, balance doubts, or just want a personal listening log: play the guided tones, tap what you hear, and save a local report in minutes.

What you can do

Check left/right, center image, low/mid/high, and frequency sweep
See the current audio output route
Keep headphone profiles and review past reports
Compare history and export reports or local data
Preview EQ/balance in Signal Lab (affects in-app playback only)
Optional local break reminders

